cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated Q-LympStage manuscript and this repository."
title: "Q-LympStage: Quantitative CE-MR Lymphangiography Analysis Code"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-02
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "袁"
    given-names: "馨儿"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code for quantitative contrast-enhanced MR
  lymphangiography (CE-MRL) staging of lower-extremity lymphedema,
  including image preprocessing, radiomic and morphologic feature
  extraction, model development and testing, model evaluation,
  subgroup analysis, reproducibility analysis, and SHAP interpretation.
keywords:
  - lymphedema
  - CE-MRL
  - radiomics
  - morphology
  - machine learning
  - medical imaging
  - artificial intelligence
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "Quantitative CE-MR Lymphangiography for Staging Lower-Extremity Lymphedema: Multicenter and Prospective Evaluation"
  authors:
    - name: "Q-LympStage Authors"
  notes: "Manuscript citation details and DOI should be updated after publication."
